    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588160/extras/79152590fd95f40a61e1c5917db643ba.avif?t=1695309567\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><strong>Super Retro Rec League Racing</strong> is a single-player, time-attack style arcade racer.  Inspired by high-speed open-wheel racing, players will need to perfect their lines, optimize every turn, remember to check their fuel, and have absolute control to dominate the tracks.  <br><br>The game is simple, but navigating the tracks at high speed requires absolute focus, as a single slip up can shatter your shot at a new record.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588160/extras/dd869c9805a0d423e73f5a1fe5a133cd.avif?t=1695309567\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>The game features 6 unique tracks, plus a second set of remixed hot-lap variations.  <br><br>The game is built on Unreal Engine 5, and supports both keyboard &amp; controller.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588160/extras/79152590fd95f40a61e1c5917db643ba.avif?t=1695309567\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><strong>Super Retro Rec League Racing</strong> is a single-player, time-attack style arcade racer.  Inspired by high-speed open-wheel racing, players will need to perfect their lines, optimize every turn, remember to check their fuel, and have absolute control to dominate the tracks.  <br><br>The game is simple, but navigating the tracks at high speed requires absolute focus, as a single slip up can shatter your shot at a new record.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588160/extras/dd869c9805a0d423e73f5a1fe5a133cd.avif?t=1695309567\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>The game features 6 unique tracks, plus a second set of remixed hot-lap variations.  <br><br>The game is built on Unreal Engine 5, and supports both keyboard &amp; controller.",
